pull every finding about your pricing with the source attached.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.960
And when it needs those fine details, it

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.600
simply finds the actual conversation and reads it

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.920
in context, instead of just guessing.

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:56.680
Here is one real example to

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:58.280
kind of put that into perspective.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.440
Let's say you're planning a new project, and you

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:03.080
want to know why an earlier approach didn't work.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.360
You just ask.

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:07.350
Your AI finds that past conversation, it uses

